        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Hanging of cotton embroidered with silks. Two rectangular panels of cream cotton base fabric sewn together, with large vertical multi-coloured scrolling floral design in straight-needle worked chain stitch. Each petal on the largest blossoms filled with different patterns."@en ;
